+## cancel
+
+Cancels a scheduled message before it is sent.
+
+```js JavaScript
+client.messages.cancel(messageId)
+```
+
+| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| `messageId` | `string` | Yes | The ID returned by `send()` with `scheduledAt` |
+
+**Returns:** `Promise<{ messageId: string, status: 'canceled' }>`
+
+**Throws:** `AcmeMailError` with `status` 409 and `code` `already_sent` if the send time has passed.
+{/* VERIFY: The API returns HTTP 409 with code `already_sent` when `cancel()` is called after the scheduled send time. */}
 
